      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 980
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Multipliziere die $-4$ in die Klammer: $7x - 8x + 20y$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "type": "task-yes-no",
      "data": {
        "question": "Stimmt das? $3a(4a + 7b) = 12a + 21b + 4a^2 + 7ab$",
        "correctAnswer": false,
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t8",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1120
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Der Faktor $3a$ ist ein Ganzes. Richtig: $3a \\cdot 4a + 3a \\cdot 7b = 12a^2 + 21ab$. Probe mit $a = b = 1$: $33 \\neq 44$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Dividiere.",
        "latex": "(12x-8y):(-4)=\\placeholder[a]{}x+\\placeholder[b]{}y",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-3",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "2",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "b",
            "latex": "-2",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "(−8y) : (−4) = +2y.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
